    <p><span data-field="subject_name">{{ subject_name }}</span> was born on <span data-field="birth_date">{{ birth_date }}</span>. He entered the University of Pennsylvania in <span data-field="entry_year">{{ entry_year }}</span> as part of the Class of <span data-field="class_year">{{ class_year }}</span>. While attending the University he was a member of the winning crew team in the Schuylkill Navy regatta and in the Childs' Cup race in <span data-field="year">{{ year }}</span>. Hart left during his senior year before graduating. He went on to become the manager of the Metropolitan</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="center-text">
    <span data-field="collection_title">{{ collection_title }}</span>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
